<title>MALAYSIA: CRICKET-ICC TROPHY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ICC TROPHY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of International</p>
<p>Cricket Council (ICC) Trophy matches on Thursday:</p>
<p>Ireland beat the United States by two wickets</p>
<p>Scores: USA 212 all out in 50 overs; Ireland 215-8 in 49.1</p>
<p>overs</p>
<p>Kenya beat Gibraltar by seven wickets</p>
<p>Scores: Kenya 46-3 in 12.4 overs; Gibraltar 44 in 27.1</p>
<p>overs</p>
<p>West Africa beat Argentina by five wickets</p>
<p>Scores: West Africa 79-5 in 20.1 overs; Argentina 77 in</p>
<p>38.1 overs</p>
<p>United Arab Emirates beat Malaysia by two wickets</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>United Arab Emirates 141-8 in 47.3 overs; Malaysia 139 in</p>
<p>49.3 overs</p>
<p>Bangladesh beat Denmark by five wickets</p>
<p>Scores: Bangladesh 99-5 in 33.5 overs; Denmark 98 in 47.3</p>
<p>overs</p>
<p>Singapore beat Israel by 68 runs</p>
<p>Scores: Singapore 204 in 50 overs; Israel 136 43.4 overs.</p>
</text>
